# The whole directory, not just *.log (2026-07-30). `logs/*.log` left
# logs/browser-audit.jsonl — a real file on the box — showing as untracked, and
# every session in this repo commits with `git add -A`. Runtime logs carry fetched
# URLs, agent output and job text; one careless add publishes them to a repo that
# is PUBLIC. Ignore the directory and keep it that way.
